        "explanation": "<p>Unpresented cheques are cheques issued by the business but not yet presented to the bank for payment. They are deducted from the bank statement balance. Conversely, deposits in transit (uncredited deposits) are added to the bank statement balance because they have been recorded by the business but not yet by the bank.</p>",
